fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstdevicemonitor.html#gst_device_monitor_get_devices","fragment":"\n\tgst_device_monitor_get_devices\n\n\n\tGst.DeviceMonitor.prototype.get_devices\n\n\n\tGst.DeviceMonitor.get_devices\n\nGets a list of devices from all of the relevant monitors. This may actually\nprobe the hardware if the monitor is not currently started.\nSince 1.28.3, this function will block until the monitor has finished\nstarting if gst_device_monitor_start has been called.\nParameters:\nA GstDeviceProvider\na GList of\nGstDevice\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.4\n\t\t\nGets a list of devices from all of the relevant monitors. This may actually\nprobe the hardware if the monitor is not currently started.\nSince 1.28.3, this function will block until the monitor has finished\nstarting if Gst.DeviceMonitor.prototype.start has been called.\nParameters:\nA Gst.DeviceProvider\na GLib.List of\nGst.Device\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.4\n\t\t\nGets a list of devices from all of the relevant monitors. This may actually\nprobe the hardware if the monitor is not currently started.\nSince 1.28.3, this function will block until the monitor has finished\nstarting if Gst.DeviceMonitor.start has been called.\nParameters:\nA Gst.DeviceProvider\na GLib.List of\nGst.Device\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.4\n\t\t\n"});